{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9636.794394,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":10120.289958000001,"text":"1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensande in die Liste der gefährdeten Welterbestätten aufgenommen."},{"kind":"audio","t":10729.630555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10731.178415999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10732.343868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":10733.922629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10736.426958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":10737.01641,"samples":9752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":18864.995532,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19392.062346000002,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film National Treasure gesehen haben, glauben Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte geschrieben stand."},{"kind":"audio","t":20056.415466000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20057.722221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20059.378414000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20061.007036000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20062.662328000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20063.643197,"samples":21733,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":26839.823989,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27285.744772000002,"text":"Kinder kommen aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien, die von Vernachlässigung bis hin zu Missbrauch reichen."},{"kind":"audio","t":27812.251974000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27813.479358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27815.139511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27816.748112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27816.984427,"samples":9640,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":29882.867005,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30074.974410000003,"text":"und sogar bis hin zu Erpressung."},{"kind":"audio","t":30232.193304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30232.478740000002,"samples":4848,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":40798.349003,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41479.823346,"text":"Das Chocamo-Tal, Chiles bedeutendstes Klettergebiet, bekannt als das Yosemite Südamerikas, mit einer Vielzahl an Granit-Big-Walls und Felsklettern."},{"kind":"audio","t":42221.306829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42222.621245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42224.246027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42225.884668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":42227.49776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42229.293035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42229.481559,"samples":4569,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":46517.212606,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46901.357614,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen wissenschaftlichen Fragen, einschließlich der Physiologie, wurden akzeptiert."},{"kind":"audio","t":47429.993598,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47431.290834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47432.942306000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47434.574218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47434.933835,"samples":10755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":54274.389731,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54662.407625,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie wachsam. Steile Steigungen, schmale Gassen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen."},{"kind":"audio","t":55222.058244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55223.422640000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55225.052802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55225.209415,"samples":5071,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"audio","t":55226.99336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55228.637622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55229.506179,"samples":20284,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":67487.992924,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68195.021376,"text":"Die Präsenz des wahren unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist ebenfalls eine einzigartige Komponente eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"audio","t":69196.264732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69197.544207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69199.305071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69200.76523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69202.367941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69203.947682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69205.606684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69207.238486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69207.377009,"samples":4513,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":73013.07905,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73419.858849,"text":"Nachdem der Unfall passiert war, wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus transportiert, verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"audio","t":73975.766265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73977.04646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73978.610411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73980.280613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73981.10049900001,"samples":19114,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":82786.34981300001,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83149.707755,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren enthalten Mandeln, Haselnüsse und andere Schalenfrüchte. Beliebte Kuchen passen oft besonders gut zu einer Tasse starkem Kaffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":83748.730802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83750.014407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83751.636928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":83751.808572,"samples":7021,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":100},{"kind":"audio","t":83754.009085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83755.3257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83756.949182,"samples":31709,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"input","t":90148.930606,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90694.098973,"text":"Es versteht sich von selbst, dass es für Sie einfacher sein wird, Portugiesisch zu lernen, wenn Sie eine romanische Sprache beherrschen."},{"kind":"audio","t":91295.314232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":91296.616857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91298.336891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91300.075285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91301.39567,"samples":28588,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":97819.195947,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98285.466556,"text":"Die Ton- und Lichtshow an den Pyramiden ist für Kinder eine der interessantesten Attraktionen in der Gegend."},{"kind":"audio","t":98834.477277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98835.814673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98837.418584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98839.085537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":98839.73487,"samples":16328,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":103710.721626,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104031.03717,"text":"Der Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten."},{"kind":"audio","t":104565.1016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":104566.503387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104568.018917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104569.663719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104569.99056600001,"samples":10476,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":106583.613015,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106820.475273,"text":"und die Wechselwirkungen, die sie untereinander eingehen."},{"kind":"audio","t":107078.817868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107080.053462,"samples":31876,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"input","t":114619.627866,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":114982.851696,"text":"Australiens Mitchell Gowrie belegte im Super-G der Männer den 11. Platz."},{"kind":"audio","t":115353.168114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115354.477939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115355.787865,"samples":27808,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":115356.316625,"samples":11981,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":121631.061865,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122075.552459,"text":"Der Teilnehmer Ulrich Joklin belegte im Super-G der Männer in der Kategorie Sitzen den 16. Platz."},{"kind":"audio","t":122560.382659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":122561.739266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122563.405698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122564.53281,"samples":26247,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":122565.204063,"samples":16718,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":128615.118096,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":129062.4748,"text":"Wie erwähnt, legen unabhängige Studien nahe, dass ein nepalesisches UN-Friedenseinsatzbattalion unwissentlich"},{"kind":"audio","t":129635.73568099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129637.141378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129638.74377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129640.37464299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129641.010385,"samples":18278,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":136531.957876,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136929.138471,"text":"Kurz nach Ausbruch der Feindseligkeiten leitete Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland ein."},{"kind":"audio","t":137448.775484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137450.142562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137451.711193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137453.388736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137453.540529,"samples":6018,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":145660.113036,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146013.705754,"text":"Es griff zudem alles an, was ins Wasser gelangte. Selbst ein riesiger Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex wäre ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"audio","t":146428.240665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146429.549021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146429.740875,"samples":8303,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":146530.428289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146531.804456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146533.442709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":146533.590242,"samples":334,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":155022.237973,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155390.299639,"text":"Der Einsatz von Videoaufzeichnungen hat zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen bei der Interpretation von Mikroexpressionen geführt."},{"kind":"audio","t":155964.820734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155966.191452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155967.759233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155969.406786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155970.419946,"samples":22179,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":159380.040252,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159666.83211,"text":"Gesichtsbewegungen, die nur wenige Millisekunden dauern."},{"kind":"audio","t":159969.453134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159970.76612000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159971.170408,"samples":12204,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":167431.094303,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167842.519562,"text":"Die Bekanntgabe erfolgte, nachdem Trump ein Telefonat mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan geführt hatte."},{"kind":"audio","t":168407.974717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168409.229622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168410.910255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168412.496477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168413.454736,"samples":20786,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":174913.70185,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175294.664872,"text":"Dies sind manchmal überfüllte Familienstrände mit einer guten Auswahl an Geschäften entlang der Küste."},{"kind":"audio","t":175787.267697,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175788.628544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175790.250386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175791.840328,"samples":31820,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"input","t":177080.483718,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177254.837008,"text":"Ich will einfach nur in Sicherheit kommen."},{"kind":"audio","t":177434.954153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177435.193548,"samples":11535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":188452.514211,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":188878.093942,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder mit Frankreich verbunden und als luxuriöse Strandresorts bekannt."},{"kind":"audio","t":189559.75557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189561.084746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189562.635407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189564.27603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189565.916342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189566.635367,"samples":16996,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"close","t":199702.336121,"code":1005}]}